(cherry picked from commit 0477ce56148b65bbaa946135a4791fe7d89b7e8d noble:linux-nvidia-6.17)
Signed-off-by: Jacob Martin <jacob.martin@canonical.com>
(cherry picked from commit a0ec48cc1d1b8a00d5951eaf8d564685aa466a4a resolute:linux-nvidia-bos)
